  "instructions": [
    "heat the olive oil in a large wok over medium-high heat.",
    "add the sliced chorizo and cook until browned, about 3-4 minutes.",
    "add the onion and garlic and cook until the onion is translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "add the bay leaf, oregano, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "add the kale and sweet potato, and stir to combine.",
    "add the chicken broth, and bring the mixture to a boil.",
    "reduce the heat to medium-low and simmer, covered, for 15-20 minutes, or until the kale is tender.",
    "stir in the heavy cream and basil, and cook for an additional 2-3 minutes, or until the stew has thickened slightly.",
    "taste and adjust the seasoning as needed.",
    "Ensure poultry is cooked to an internal temperature of 74°C / 165°F (juices run clear, no pink remaining) before serving."
